History:

1.0 - 30.7.94
      Initial Release

1.1 - 31.7.94
      Now uses Arrays in the ARexx Script (done by MG), 
      code shrunk from 27K to 4K ;)
      0's in the letters replaced in #'s by PA
      Renamed from Clock to E!Clock ;)

1.2 - 21.8.94
      Now uses ANSI Screen Positioning Code for Realtime Time-Display Update
      The strange Chars which were displayed at IBM Terminal Emulation are removed

